Sun Oct 25 17:40:25 UTC 2026 - Atri Bhattacharya <badshah400@gmail.com>

- Update to version 2.20.0:
  + Improve type hints for
    - Adw: Update to 1.10.0.
    - Gtk4: Update to 4.24.1.
    - Atspi: Update to 2.62.1 (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#325).
    - Rsvg: Update to 2.63.3 (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#315).
  + Bug Fixes
    - Generator: Write aliases after the classes in the same
      module.
    - Gtk3: Add missing import of `Collection`
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#324).
    - Generator: Build type vars before writing imports
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#321).
- Changes from version 2.19.0:
  + Improve type hints for:
    - GLib.
    - GLibUnix.
  + Bug Fixes:
    - GLib: Fix annotation for io_add_watch().
    - Fix regressions.
- Changes from version 2.18.0:
  + New feature: new update script with stub selection options
    (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#303).
  + Improvements
    - asyncio-related stubs in events and `Gio`
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#309).
    - vfunc and `AsyncReadyCallback` signatures
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#308).
    - generate async overloads for finish-func methods
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#307).
    - property and enum stub generation
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#306).
    - add `--format` to run formatters on the generated stub
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#301).
    - rewrite generator type/callback handling
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#298).
    - always use `__init__` instead of `__new__`
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#295).
    - class generation, props typing, and `__init__` arguments
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#294).
    - constant and property annotations
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#288).
    - properly type read-only properties
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#286).
    - assign aliases, update inheritance
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#285).
    - use versioned imports to improve type checking
    - typing in generate script
    - bump and use ruff instead of isort
    - enum and flags classes inheritance
    - Add typings for `gi._gi` (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#272).
    - Add default for `ListModel` type param
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#271).
  + Typing: Almost all libs were updated due to generator
    improvements
  + Bug Fixes:
    - `__get__` for FunctionInfo and VFuncInfo should return Self
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#310).
    - accept bytes in `GdkPixbuf.Pixbuf.new_from_data()`
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#300).
    - gstreamer stubs (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#289).
    - class bases generation (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#293).
    - `GInterface` and `GObject.Object` shape and inheritance
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#290).
    - actually add the `Gio.ListModel` default to the stub
      (gh#pygobject/pygobject-stubs#238).
    - use `main()` and call `gi.require()`

